    "weight": 10,
    "editorNotes": "Once the mascot of the format, recent changes have seen Giratina's play decline. It is weak to both of its sub-typings and no longer stands out as the best Ghost or the best Dragon. While its place in the metagame is shaky, it's still plenty competitive. The regular version has the longer tenure, and the Shadow version may be held back by its moderate pacing."
  },
